{"4582660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "REK", "steam_appid": 4582660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Compete to be a Robot Pilot!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By competing in the REK Beta, the top pilots earn the chance to step off the screen and onto the main stage at an official REK Event.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to REK </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/5204a71955cc853caa74c0c3beb3cd4e.avif?t=1788211060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras_big/5204a71955cc853caa74c0c3beb3cd4e.webp?t=1788211060 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THIS IS NOT A GAME, IT'S A SIMULATOR. </strong>The simulator is driven by the same neural nets that power our real humanoid robots. Get good at the sim, get good at real humanoid fights.No canned animations. Just physics-based humanoid combat: every punch, block, and stumble governed by real physics and self-balancing AI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the sim. REK the competition. Become a real pilot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/841ec7b207d8472f1943764a0ea4f5c6.avif?t=1788211060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras_big/841ec7b207d8472f1943764a0ea4f5c6.webp?t=1788211060 width=1560 height=366 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flatscreen or VR, Steam Deck or PC, keyboard or controller, <strong>you embody your machine.</strong> Everything from the movement to the keybindings is designed to make you a better pilot in real life.Master your robot's weight, momentum, and balance to dominate.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Today, you start with our modded version of a Unitree G1. Sooner than later, that won’t be the only robot you get to pilot. <strong>Expect the unexpected.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/a6aa81728b96a2c979caeb0664ddebd6.avif?t=1788211060\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras_big/a6aa81728b96a2c979caeb0664ddebd6.webp?t=1788211060 width=1560 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s a live arena with a queue. The scoreboard counts every clean hit, rounds are on the clock, and ties go to sudden death. There’s always a fight waiting for you.<strong> Every hit, every win takes you higher in the championship leaderboard. </strong>The best pilots won't just win the game, they'll earn the chance to pilot a <strong>real humanoid robot</strong> at a live REK Event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So are you up for the challenge? Are you made for the combat sport of the future? Only one way to find out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/cf6ed848275f5556265bedbccda55d85.poster.avif?t=1788211060\" width=1170 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/cf6ed848275f5556265bedbccda55d85.webm?t=1788211060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4582660/extras/cf6ed848275f5556265bedbccda55d85.mp4?t=1788211060\